        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Mission Whilkas</strong>, you take control of a brave cat equipped with a jetpack, on a mission to retrieve the legendary Whilkas cat food recipe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game consists of a single, but challenging level that will test your platforming skills! Use agility and clever thinking to reach your goal and complete the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ <strong>Note:</strong> The game is short and can be completed in under two hours. If you finish the mission faster, Steam’s standard refund policy applies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute cat with a jetpack 🐱🚀</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One level packed with tough platforming challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, but engaging mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging, fair, and fun gameplay</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Mission Whilkas</strong>, you take control of a brave cat equipped with a jetpack, on a mission to retrieve the legendary Whilkas cat food recipe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game consists of a single, but challenging level that will test your platforming skills! Use agility and clever thinking to reach your goal and complete the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ <strong>Note:</strong> The game is short and can be completed in under two hours. If you finish the mission faster, Steam’s standard refund policy applies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute cat with a jetpack 🐱🚀</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One level packed with tough platforming challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, but engaging mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging, fair, and fun gameplay</p></li></ul>",
